## Rules

- **Maximum 10 tool calls per request.** Quality over quantity.
- **Never fetch every search result.** Pick the 1-3 best.
- **Never repeat the same search** with slightly different wording — refine the query instead.
- **Always include `ORDER BY`** in CQL and JQL queries for deterministic results.
- **Use relative dates** in JQL (`"-7d"`, `"-1w"`) instead of absolute dates.
- **Confluence pages are returned as Markdown** — already clean, no HTML parsing needed.
- **Custom field IDs differ between Cloud and Server/DC** — use `jira_search_fields` to discover them.
- When you don't know which space/project to search, start broad and narrow down.
- If a tool is missing or returns an error, work with what you have — don't retry endlessly.
- For write operations, provide clear summaries of what will be created/changed before proceeding.

